### Metrics Decoded

| Metric | Formula | Interpretation |
|---|---|---|
| **R²** | 1 - SS_res/SS_tot | % of variance explained. 1.0 = perfect |
| **RMSE** | √(mean((y - ŷ)²)) | Penalizes large errors. Same unit as y |
| **MAE** | mean(\|y - ŷ\|) | Average absolute error. More robust to outliers |
| **OOB Score** | R² on OOB samples | Free estimate of generalization performance |

